ibus-ngosen (1.1.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Typing with Sen runs on the core and types straight into X11 apps.
  * Keep tone keys typed together on GNOME; type the first word of an
    empty field straight in GTK, Firefox and LibreOffice.
  * kitty on X11 types through IBus.
  * On/off items in the input source menu are marked items, so the menu
    closes the same way on every click.
  * Core ngosen-1.7.5-1.

